    "step1": {
      "type": "feature-split",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "green",
        "image_side": "right",
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "UV Shield+",
        "subhead": "Daily support for active, sun-ready skin†",
        "product": "uv-shield",
        "asset": "lifestyle-uvshield-rocks.webp",
        "ratio": "4x5",
        "body": "<p>UV Shield+ combines five ingredients selected for complementary nutritional and antioxidant roles relevant to environmental and UV-associated skin stress:</p><ul><li>Niacinamide</li><li>Polypodium leucotomos</li><li>EGCG</li><li>Trans-resveratrol</li><li>Spirulina</li></ul><p>Its formula is designed around several different biological pathways rather than relying on a single antioxidant or botanical.</p><p><strong>Primary support areas:</strong> environmental stress, antioxidant support, outdoor lifestyle support, daily skin resilience.†</p>",
        "primary_label": "Explore UV Shield+"
      }
    },
    "step2": {
      "type": "feature-split",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "light",
        "image_side": "left",
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "Skinbiotic+",
        "subhead": "Daily probiotic for gut and skin health",
        "product": "skinbiotic",
        "asset": "lifestyle-skinbiotic-cliffs.webp",
        "ratio": "4x5",
        "body": "<p>Skinbiotic+ combines organic inulin with multiple probiotic organisms in a synbiotic formula built around gut health, microbiome support, and the gut-skin connection.† Its formula includes:</p><ul><li>Organic inulin</li><li>Lactobacillus plantarum</li><li>Bifidobacterium lactis</li><li>Lactobacillus rhamnosus</li><li>Bifidobacterium bifidum</li><li>Akkermansia muciniphila Akk11®</li></ul><p>The formulation rationale is prebiotic support and multiple complementary microbial roles.†</p><p><strong>Primary support areas:</strong> gut-skin connection, microbiome balance, synbiotic support, internal balance.†</p>",
        "primary_label": "Explore Skinbiotic+"
      }
    },
    "step3": {
      "type": "feature-split",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "dark",
        "image_side": "right",
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "Dermaboost+",
        "subhead": "Daily immune support for calm, balanced skin†",
        "product": "dermaboost",
        "asset": "lifestyle-dermaboost-yacht.webp",
        "ratio": "4x5",
        "body": "<p>Dermaboost+ adds broader nutritional support through vitamins, minerals, carotenoids, and botanical polyphenols.† The formula includes:</p><ul><li>Niacinamide</li><li>Vitamin D3</li><li>Vitamin C</li><li>Zinc</li><li>Quercetin</li><li>Curcumin</li><li>Olive leaf extract</li><li>Astaxanthin</li></ul><p>Its role in the bundle is broader antioxidant, nutritional, and normal immune support.†</p><p><strong>Primary support areas:</strong> antioxidant support, normal immune function, nutritional skin support, daily skin resilience.†</p>",
        "primary_label": "Explore Dermaboost+"
      }
    },
